</span></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Maps and Pictures</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"map\">\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Minotaur Hell\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"94\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Minotaur_Hell_b6b64e.png\" width=\"125\"/></span> <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Mino Hell\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"91\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Mino_Hell_341767.jpg\" width=\"125\"/></span> <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Route Mino hell\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"76\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Route_Mino_hell_b200d0.jpg\" width=\"125\"/></span> </div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"implementation-date\">5.2<br/>March 17, 2000<br/>Beta 5.2</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: Hunting Places <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<p><b>Minotaur Hell</b> is a cave that lies north of <a href=\"#/wiki/Rookgaard\">Rookgaard</a>. It can be accessed through the main Rookgaard cave, <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32094,32137,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32094, 32137, 7)</a>. You will meet Snakes, <a href=\"#/wiki/Wolf\">Wolves</a>, Trolls, <a href=\"#/wiki/Orc\">Orcs</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Minotaur\">Minotaurs</a> on the way to Minotaur Hell. It is a dangerous place to hunt alone, therefor it is recommended to bring a team. But if hunting alone, a good idea to take a box and let only one or two attack at a time. There is a <a href=\"#/wiki/Minotaur%20Mage\">Minotaur Mage</a> visible in a room to the west, although it is unreachable. There is a book regarding his presence there.\n</p><p>Since the Christmas Update 2006 a boss creature, <a href=\"#/wiki/Apprentice%20Sheng\">Apprentice Sheng</a> has a chance of spawning.\n</p>\n<div style=\"padding-top:1px;overflow:auto\">\n<p>The <a href=\"#/quest/minotaur-hell-quest\">Minotaur Hell Quest</a> is located here.\n</p>\n</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Creatures\">Creatures</span></h2>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div><table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">Exp</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">HP</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Max. Damage</th><th style=\"font-size: small;\">Loot</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Wolf\"><img alt=\"Wolf\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Wolf_ef937d.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Wolf\">Wolf</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">18</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">25</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"white-space: nowrap\">17 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Physical%20Damage\"><img alt=\"Physical Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Physical_Damage_Icon_356411.gif\" width=\"9\"/></a></span></span></span></td><td style=\"font-size: small;\"><div class=\"loot-table\" id=\"w-loot_perc_loot